      "writtenOn": "2022-09-08T19:29:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Considering that there is only ~1 case of an existing `.clang-tidy` file, can we please just make it explicit in the `Android.bp`, and then suppress the search. Searching goes against the explicit model that Soong and other build systems are built on, where we don\u0027t want implicit/default behaviors to be accidentally used.",
      "parentUuid": "7c9a8d51_8b125f84",
      "revId": "3c00a98317f61cdd0751dd56a348a620a274f3d7",
